{"total_count":3,"incomplete_results":false,"items":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cacti/cacti/issues/9014","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cacti/cacti","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cacti/cacti/issues/9014/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cacti/cacti/issues/9014/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cacti/cacti/issues/9014/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Cacti/cacti/pull/9014","id":6657026094,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAcF0qc8AAAABSeyXOg","number":9014,"title":"fix(security): [1.2.x] harden user settings validation, Guest writes, and realtime graph access","user":{"login":"somethingwithproof","id":341181,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MTE4MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/341181?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/somethingwithproof","html_url":"https://github.com/somethingwithproof","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/somethingwithproof/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/somethingwithproof/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/somethingwithproof/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/somethingwithproof/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/somethingwithproof/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/somethingwithproof/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/somethingwithproof/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/somethingwithproof/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/somethingwithproof/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-11-28T01:06:06Z","updated_at":"2026-11-28T01:28:03Z","closed_at":"2026-11-28T01:28:13Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cacti/cacti/pulls/9014","html_url":"https://github.com/Cacti/cacti/pull/9014","diff_url":"https://github.com/Cacti/cacti/pull/9014.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Cacti/cacti/pull/9014.patch","merged_at":"2026-11-28T01:28:13Z"},"body":"## Summary\n\nHardens user-preference validation, Guest account write restrictions, graph preview/tree pagination bounds, and realtime graph access control on `1.2.x`.\n\n### Changes\n\n- **User-setting schema validation (`lib/user_setting_validation.php`, `auth_profile.php`, `lib/functions.php`)**:\n  - Adds schema validation against `$settings_user` field definitions (`checkbox`, `drop_array`, `themes`, `drop_language`, `drop_sql`, `drop_color`, numeric/time `textbox`, and `font`) plus Guest-account and numeric/interval/hash sanitization helpers.\n  - Enforces `csrf_require_post()` on `auth_profile.php?action=update_data`.\n  - Rejects Guest account mutations with HTTP 403 across profile handlers (`logout_everywhere`, `clear_user_settings`, `reset_default`, `update_data`, `save`) and returns early in `save_user_settings()`.\n  - Enforces `is_view_allowed('graph_settings')` and schema validation (HTTP 400 on invalid values) in `api_auth_update_user_setting()`.\n- **Graph pagination and numeric settings (`lib/html_graph.php`, `graph_view.php`, `lib/html_tree.php`)**:\n  - Backports `html_graph_validate_columns()` and `html_graph_validate_page_size()` to `lib/html_graph.php` and validates `preview_graphs_per_page` and `num_columns` defaults.\n  - Validates and clamps `$graphs` and `$page` as positive integers before constructing the SQL `LIMIT` clause in `graph_view.php`, and validates `treeview_graphs_per_page` and `num_columns_tree` in `lib/html_tree.php`.\n  - Casts `min_tree_width`, `max_tree_width`, and `page_refresh` to bounded integers before `<script>` output.\n- **Realtime graph authorization and argument hardening (`graph_realtime.php`)**:\n  - Enforces `is_graph_allowed($local_graph_id)` returning HTTP 403 before invoking `shell_exec()` and before reading cached files in `case 'view'`.\n  - Anchors `graph_nolegend` validation to `/^(true|false)$/`.\n  - Validates `sess_realtime_hash`, clamps `ds_step` via `cacti_sanitize_realtime_interval()`, escapes `$hash` with `cacti_escapeshellarg()`, and blocks Guest writes to `set_user_setting()`.\n- **Regression tests (`tests/Unit/Security/InputValidation/UserSettingsAndRealtimeHardeningTest.php`)**:\n  - Covers Guest detection, schema validation across field methods, numeric/interval/hash sanitizers, column/page-size validators, and source-level guard assertions.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `php -l` passed on all 8 modified/added files.\n- Pest regression suite (`tests/Unit/Security/InputValidation/UserSettingsAndRealtimeHardeningTest.php`): 6 passed (64 assertions).\n- Commit is DCO-signed and GPG-signed.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cacti/cacti/issues/9014/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cacti/cacti/issues/9014/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cacti/cacti/issues/1916","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cacti/cacti","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cacti/cacti/issues/1916/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cacti/cacti/issues/1916/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cacti/cacti/issues/1916/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Cacti/cacti/issues/1916","id":359088822,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUzNTkwODg4MjI=","number":1916,"title":"[1.2.0] Cannot save User Settings","user":{"login":"skyjou","id":13309854,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMzA5ODU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13309854?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/skyjou","html_url":"https://github.com/skyjou","f